cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use the HelioFITS suite in your research, please cite the suite (its
  Zenodo DOI is on this repository's record) and each program you used, at the
  version you used.
type: software
title: HelioFITS suite
abstract: >-
  The HelioFITS suite is desktop software for looking at solar and
  heliospheric imagery. HelioFITS Peek teaches macOS Finder and Quick Look to read
  solar FITS files; HelioFITS Studio, a fork of JHelioviewer, is a viewer for
  coronagraph and wide-field data with the Helioradial projections and the
  RHEF filter; Heliogram is a companion app for public outreach. Each program
  is versioned and archived separately.
